// g7250_main_usart2.repl — generic USART2 (models/csharp/G7250Usart.cs,
// docs/USART-model.md) in place of Renode 1.17's STM32F7_USART, so USART2 RX
// and TX run through the DMA (DMAMUX1 requests usart2_rx_dma 43 and
// usart2_tx_dma 44, ST RM0468 DMAMUX1 request table).
//
// Load procedure (the runners do this), after g7250_main_dma.repl:
//   i @models/csharp/G7250Usart.cs
//   sysbus Unregister sysbus.usart2
//   machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/g7250_main_usart2.repl
// The interrupt goes the same way as in the base platform (EXTI line 27).
usart2: UART.G7250Usart @ sysbus <0x40004400, +0x400>
    usartName: "USART2"
    frequency: 125000000
    IRQ -> exti@27
    RxDma -> dmamux1@43
    TxDma -> dmamux1@44
